l unrelated Slack read and no failures, which argues against a broad Slack outage.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_595438a01016", "record_id": "slack-redirect-046:logs:1"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_199cec447840", "record_id": "slack-redirect-046:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "verification_control", "statement": "Public documentation in the incident evidence states that the shortened connection link is distinct from the static OAuth callback URI, matching the observed Cedar misconfiguration.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_4a7744d18321", "record_id": "slack-redirect-046:knowledge:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["oauth_redirect_uri_mismatch_remediation", "verify_custom_oauth_app", "monitor_provider"]}}
